<title>USA: Omaha hogs $1.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $1.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 lower.</p>
<p>Top $59.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3    230-260 lbs    59.50</p>
<p>US  2-3    260-280 lbs    58.50-59.00</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. 0.50-3.00 lower. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     350-450 lbs    46.50-47.00</p>
<p>	     450-500 lbs    47.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     500-650 lbs    47.50-48.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8723))</p>
